{"id": "clm:65d75e5592a2ccd6eeb5e0f1611711971186334ab30d15db66e48433beee3e12", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas apportions support charges by cloud usage and lists separate provider support rows. Its example divides support 50% to AWS, 30% to Google Cloud, and 20% to Microsoft Azure. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-18)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/additional-services/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Support line items per cloud provider on invoices"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "measures", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/invoice-breakdown/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:eb8b04b3807b04f9faf1e6ad5d1e66e39604a70a0707af41f72ea2a67ba3907e", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:cd51c4dc79076c1cf3cba416d4c6d215874ee1f14e13b4f4d5abd1f8482f6baa"]}
{"id": "clm:be15792f75ca19af5ecae1f6974f0e658bb6106c3bb861c6e8fd35624686a7cb", "type": "statement", "text": "The invoice Summary shows total monthly paid support; Details shows the provider-level support line items. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-18)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/additional-services/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Support line items per cloud provider on invoices"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:eb8b04b3807b04f9faf1e6ad5d1e66e39604a70a0707af41f72ea2a67ba3907e", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:42f4e564dddca895f32c3db7620e848040947261f222e3cde8d43d761fa88def"]}
{"id": "clm:b81ed968903d13dcf49abdcef9313e1f586bbd98ca70645bb66c0043c3ef38fc", "type": "statement", "text": "A provider without usage has no support row. Support usage without a cloud association appears under Other Atlas Usage. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-18)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/additional-services/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Support line items per cloud provider on invoices"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/invoice-breakdown/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:eb8b04b3807b04f9faf1e6ad5d1e66e39604a70a0707af41f72ea2a67ba3907e", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:e7c978d60c1e333322b27053712b70c62e73d15fcb06dad48641c3616e7c135a"]}
{"id": "clm:d03bda3d6f2bd4fb7e7633995dea698751f1c75b63d5e205a4503b5782307338", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas applies one monthly support minimum to the entire organization, separately from provider allocation. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-18)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/additional-services/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Support line items per cloud provider on invoices"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/invoice-breakdown/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:eb8b04b3807b04f9faf1e6ad5d1e66e39604a70a0707af41f72ea2a67ba3907e", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:84adfa3de9de2135ffc3064b75b8dde9c86cc0dbde17521bd8f85236656fd162"]}
{"id": "clm:1deb98ea6fdc613f83a4469bd3958a15a22bfccf76d9ef99cceedeab36ef1401", "type": "statement", "text": "For marketplace commitments, Atlas routes each provider's support to that marketplace. With mixed payments, other provider charges can go directly to Atlas. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-18)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/invoice-breakdown/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Support line items per cloud provider on invoices"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:eb8b04b3807b04f9faf1e6ad5d1e66e39604a70a0707af41f72ea2a67ba3907e", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:4d1b2c90c7ea180451fecf772c554531c76b9d74245ddf68211f0d707097fbd8"]}
{"id": "clm:5ca4bab979eee7034a2d37ef6214f64875c280b7e9461a3beb3bac1099fc2773", "type": "statement", "text": "If monthly support usage falls below the minimum, Atlas charges the difference to the primary payment method at month end. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-18)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/invoice-breakdown/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Support line items per cloud provider on invoices"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:eb8b04b3807b04f9faf1e6ad5d1e66e39604a70a0707af41f72ea2a67ba3907e", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:8071939cbedd42f4ddcaa37234b60f1ed8e86f9767eefaa0f6aa6d825057fd48"]}
